VERDICT: PASS -- all three authored steps pass. The defining property of SSM is proven
on the wire by counted traffic, not by a table read: the joined CHANNEL is delivered
while the SAME GROUP from a DIFFERENT SOURCE is dropped in the same leg, on the same
wire, at the same instant, with both flows sharing one link-layer address.
