            tools/ckcon.py, tools/ckyn.py and tools/console.py drive the consoles;
            tools/ckreload.py drove the reload; tools/rc2cfg.py produced the .cfg files.

  Method: every leg carries the subject channel, a control that must NOT arrive, and an
  instrument control (routed ICMP unicast 10.38.22.40 -> 10.38.22.65) that must always
  arrive. The instrument control arrived at FULL count in all 10 counted legs, so every
  zero below is a measurement and not a dead capture. It arrives with Ethernet source
  88:9d:98:df:26:02 = swi_a's MAC, which proves the two-router path is real.

